### Get balance for an existing account
GET {{host}}/balances/5b19c8b6-0cc4-4c72-a989-0c2ee15fa975
Accept: application/json
# X-API-Key: local-dev-key

### Missing account should respond with JSON 404
GET {{host}}/balances/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json
# X-API-Key: local-dev-key

### Invalid account id should respond with JSON 400
GET {{host}}/balances/not-a-uuid
Accept: application/json
# X-API-Key: local-dev-key
